# COUNTING RULE, stated because it changed two of my own numbers before this log was written. A UVM run ends
# with a tally line whose text is UVM_ERROR, a colon and a count, carrying no message, and grep -c UVM_ERROR
# count below matches '^UVM_ERROR [^:]' instead. My first pass reported 3, 409 and 410 where the truth is
# 2, 408 and 409. This is the third time this session that a tally line has inflated a count (334 against 343
