# ================ WHAT I GOT WRONG BEFORE THIS LOG, RECORDED BECAUSE IT REACHED THE ORCHESTRATOR ===========
# When I paused the counter touch I wrote that fixing the Medium would make seed 1207954461 fire MORE. That
# was a consequence I asserted without deriving it and it is not right: the entry restart at :112 resets every
# surviving expectation at every entry and this landing does not change it, so in a regime where entries recur
# the accrued count never builds. The seed's own log then showed the fires have nothing to do with either
# semantics. The rule I am taking from it is the one I keep relearning: a consequence stated to someone else
# is a claim, and a claim needs the measurement first.
